ts they don&#8217;t actually need. We do things differently. We provide a complete breakdown of <strong>Kelvinator AC repair charges Vadodara</strong> before any work starts. We explain the problem in plain language and tell you exactly what it will cost to fix it right. No surprises, just elite engineering service.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">What Our Engineers Fix For You</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">From precision home repairs to critical industrial panel cooling maintenance.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A202C]/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repairing-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"General Kelvinator AC Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n           